# Task 147-008 Execution Plan

## Goal
Implement NervousHistory class for JSONL append-only audit trail with undo support and retention.

## Files to Create
1. `src/nervous/history.ts` (~250 LoC) - NervousHistory class
2. `tests/nervous/history.test.ts` (~200 LoC) - 8 test cases

## Approach
1. Implement NervousHistory class with:
   - append(): atomic JSONL line append
   - readAll(): parse all records from file
   - findById(): lookup by record ID
   - findRecentReversible(): filter reversible+success, newest first
   - markUndone(): append compensation record (no delete)
   - prune(): drop records older than N days, rewrite file
2. Write tests using temp directories for isolation
3. Verify with tsc --noEmit and vitest run

## Key Decisions
- Use appendFile for atomic append (OS-level atomic for single writes < PIPE_BUF)
- prune() rewrites file (only destructive op — drops old records)
- markUndone() appends new compensation record, never deletes original
- All methods async (fs/promises)
